  "idea": "How to extract text from a screenshot or image without retyping it",
  "text": "The tiny keyboard shortcut that saves beginners hours of manual typing. Retyping error messages, serial codes, or book quotes onto your computer is exhausting busywork. A mistyped character in an API key ruins your setup and wastes thirty minutes troubleshooting. Open Windows Snipping Tool with Windows key plus Shift plus S, then select Text Actions to copy words. You extract clean, editable text without touching a keyboard key.",
